abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. A totally positive definite quadratic lattice of rank n over a totally real field represents at most n classes of totally positive units modulo squares of units, which answers a question of Daans, Kala, Man, Widmer and Yatsyna negatively. The bound is a short consequence of standard facts on finite reflection groups. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
